Z||000003||Stoic||12-22-2000||03:10 PM||||$400 bucks! wow.  I think I may have solved my own problem.  I found a guy here in town at an autowreckers.  He has 13 fieros between him and his wife!  He's done many swaps and said he could do it for about $700.  Much better than $2500.  90 day warrenty too.  Anyway thanks for the input guys.<P>------------------<BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||6
